  "description": "\"Consensual divorce, I don't do that.\"  \nThe daughter of the prime minister and a famous movie star, Iroha is arranged to marry Kang Yi-gyeom, the eldest son of the Do Sung Group, for her father's political influence. But unlike Yi Gyeom, who has no feelings for her, she falls in love with him from the moment they meet. When the two years of the contract expire and she wants to ask for a divorce, Lee Gyeom is the first to ask her for a divorce.  \nAt that moment, she realizes that something is wrong...\n\nTwo people who have put their divorce on hold, where are their feelings for each other...!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=10242784), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/505075709), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/62963881), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000059958), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=230908), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/divorce__), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/pending_divorce), [Onestory](https://onestory.co.kr/detail/H045233491), [Nate](https://toonnbook.nate.com/detail/H045233491)\n\n**Official Translations:**     \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/174088)",
